This is a JHipster-generated monolithic application using JWT authentication and an SQL database. JHipster follows standard project structure and conventions for full-stack development.

- *Frontend code** is located in the `src/main/webapp` directory
- *Backend code** is located in the `src/main` directory
- *Typical JHipster Project Structure:**

```

[project-name]

├── .cursor/

├── .devcontainer/

├── .github/

├── .husky/                  # Git hooks

├── .mvn/                    # Maven wrapper

├── node_modules/

├── src/

│   ├── main/

│   │   ├── docker/          # Docker configurations

│   │   ├── java/            # Backend source code

│   │   ├── resources/       # Backend resources & configuration

│   │   └── webapp/          # Frontend source code

│   └── test/

│       ├── java/            # Backend tests

│       ├── javascript/      # Frontend tests

│       │   └── cypress/     # E2E tests

│       ├── gatling/         # Performance tests (if enabled)

│       └── resources/       # Test resources

├── target/                  # Build output

├── webpack/                 # Webpack configuration

├── .editorconfig

├── .gitattributes

├── .gitignore

├── .lintstagedrc.cjs

├── .prettierignore

├── .prettierrc

├── .yo-rc.json             # JHipster configuration

├── README.md

├── checkstyle.xml

├── cypress-audits.config.ts (if Cypress enabled)

├── cypress.config.ts       (if Cypress enabled)

├── eslint.config.mjs

├── [project-name].jdl      # JDL entity definitions (if used)

├── jest.conf.js

├── mvnw / mvnw.cmd         # Maven wrapper

├── npmw / npmw.cmd         # NPM wrapper

├── package-lock.json

├── package.json

├── pom.xml

├── postcss.config.js

├── sonar-project.properties

├── tsconfig.json

└── tsconfig.test.json

```

